  "title": "Bob's Smoked Pulled Pork",
  "description": "This smoked pulled pork recipe brines pork shoulder in cider, then coats it in a sweet and spicy rub before smoking over hickory coals until perfectly tender.",
  "authors": [
    "bobthecook1"
  ],
